          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിശ്രമം (viśramaṁ) from Sanskrit viśrama, \"rest\", taken over whole as a tatsama, with Malayalam's noun ending -ṁ (CDIAL 11947). Its root is śram, \"to toil\": rest is the stop after toil."
            }
          ]
        },
